 \"Inter Fallback\"","fontSize":"13px","fontWeight":"400","letterSpacing":"normal","lineHeight":"20px","textTransform":"none","color":"oklab(0.199998 -0.0104908 -0.0259555 / 0.65)","textAlign":"start"},{"text":"Filter fast, heart finalists as you go, then compare them side by side on the same copy","bbox":{"x":583,"y":292,"w":253,"h":73},"fontFamily":"Inter, \"Inter Fallback\"","fontSize":"13px","fontWeight":"400","letterSpacing":"normal","lineHeight":"17.875px","textTransform":"none","color":"oklab(0.199998 -0.0104908 -0.0259555 / 0.65)","textAlign":"left"},{"text":"Open a finalist: every weight on your text, glyph map, OpenType alternates, overlay against another font","bbox":{"x":611,"y":282,"w":244,"h":75},"fontFamily":"Inter, \"Inter Fallback\"","fontSize":"13px","fontWeight":"400","letterSpacing":"normal","lineHeight":"17.875px","textTransform":"none","color":"oklab(0.199998 -0.0104908 -0.0259555 / 0.65)","textAlign":"left"},{"text":"Do my fonts leave my computer?","bbox":{"x":34,"y":606,"w":472,"h":38},"fontFamily":"Inter, \"Inter Fallback\"","fontSize":"13px","fontWeight":"500","letterSpacing":"normal","lineHeight":"17.875px","textTransform":"none","color":"lab(7.16428 -2.04707 -9.41066)","textAlign":"left"},{"text":"Which browsers work?","bbox":{"x":34,"y":650,"w":472,"h":38},"fontFamily":"Inter, \"Inter Fallback\"","fontSize":"13px","fontWeight":"500","letterSpacing":"normal","lineHeight":"17.875px","textTransform":"none","color":"lab(7.16428 -2.04707 -9.41066)","textAlign":"left"},{"text":"Does fromT install or change anything?","bbox":{"x":34,"y":694,"w":472,"h":38},"fontFamily":"Inter, \"Inter Fallback\"","fontSize":"13px","fontWeight":"500","letterSpacing":"normal","lineHeight":"17.875px","textTransform":"none","color":"lab(7.16428 -2.04707 -9.41066)","textAlign":"left"},{"text":"Does it work with Cyrillic?","bbox":{"x":34,"y":738,"w":472,"h":38},"fontFamily":"Inter, \"Inter Fallback\"","fontSize":"13px","fontWeight":"500","letterSpacing":"normal","lineHeight":"17.875px","textTransform":"none","color":"lab(7.16428 -2.04707 -9.41066)","textAlign":"left"},{"text":"How do I get my shortlist into Figma?","bbox":{"x":34,"y":782,"w":472,"h":38},"fontFamily":"Inter, \"Inter Fallback\"","fontSize":"13px","fontWeight":"500","letterSpacing":"normal","lineHeight":"17.875px","textTransform":"none","color":"lab(7.16428 -2.04707 -9.41066)","textAlign":"left"},{"text":"What does it cost?","bbox":{"x":34,"y":825,"w":472,"h":38},"fontFamily":"Inter, \"Inter Fallback\"","fontSize":"13px","fontWeight":"500","letterSpacing":"normal","lineHeight":"17.875px","textTransform":"none","color":"lab(7.16428 -2.04707 -9.41066)","textAlign":"left"},{"text":"Nothing. No accounts either — your shortlist lives in your browser and only reaches our relay if you turn on Figma sync.","bbox":{"x":34,"y":863,"w":472,"h":37},"fontFamily":"Inter, \"Inter Fallback\"","fontSize":"13px","fontWeight":"400","letterSpacing":"normal","lineHeight":"20px","textTransform":"none","color":"oklab(0.199998 -0.0104908 -0.0259555 / 0.65)","textAlign":"start"},{"text":"Cast your whole local library on real project text. Fast scroll, Cyrillic included","bbox":{"x":591,"y":311,"w":258,"h":54},"fontFamily":"Inter, \"Inter Fallback\"","fontSize":"13px","fontWeight":"400","letterSpacing":"normal","lineHeight":"17.875px","textTransform":"none","color":"oklab(0.199998 -0.0104908 -0.0259555 / 0.65)","textAlign":"left"},{"text":"Study","bbox":{"x":617,"y":255,"w":241,"h":47},"fontFamily":"Inter, \"Inter Fallback\"","fontSize":"16px","fontWeight":"700","letterSpacing":"-0.4px","lineHeight":"24px","textTransform":"none","color":"lab(7.16428 -2.04707 -9.41066)","textAlign":"left"},{"text":"Shortlist","bbox":{"x":580,"y":263,"w":250,"h":45},"fontFamily":"Inter, \"Inter Fallback\"","fontSize":"16px","fontWeight":"700","letterSpacing":"-0.4px","lineHeight":"24px","textTransform":"none","color":"lab(7.16428 -2.04707 -9.41066)","textAlign":"left"},{"text":"Send finalists straight to Fig